  "program_text": "BLOCK 2 — Sep 7 to Oct 11, 2026\nINTENT\nAdd to the total. 248 kg now, 255 by Oct 11, 260 by Dec 25.\nThe snatch is 91% of the clean & jerk. It should be 78–82%\nFive days, Monday to Friday. 75 minutes a session, three to four movements.\nMAXES — all percentages run off these\nLift\tMax\nSnatch\t118 kg\nClean & jerk\t130 kg\nTotal\t248 kg\nFront squat — working\t130 kg\n\t\nWEEKLY SHAPE\nDay\tFocus\nMon\tUpper — incline DB bench, row, press, arms\nTue\tFront squat + clean pull\nWed\tAlternates two-week: jerk from rack + block snatch ⇄ snatch balance + block clean\nThu\tClean + front squat + jerk complex, snatch pull\nFri\tHeavy — clean & jerk, snatch\nWEEK 1 — Sep 7 to 12 · DELOAD\nKnees, upper back and shoulders. One heavy session, Friday. No squatting, no pulls until then.\nMON — off\nTUE — Upper, light. Upper back is the target\n* Pull-ups 3×8, strict, full hang\n* Incline DB bench 3×8 @ 45 lb\n* Chest-supported row 3×12 light, 2 s squeeze\n* Band pull-aparts 3×15 + face pulls 3×15\nWED — Hip, low back, knee recovery\n* Hip mobility circuit, 3 sets each\n* Hip abductor 3 × 15 s iso @ 110 lb\n* Hip adductor 3 × 15 s iso @ 110 lb\n* Back extensions 3×12\n* Spanish squat iso 3 × 30 s + terminal knee extensions 3×15/side\nTHU — Arms and shoulders\n* Seated DB shoulder press 3×8 @ 40 lb\n* Lateral raises 3×12 @ 20–25 lb\n* DB curls 2×10 @ 30 lb + triceps pushdown 3×12\n* Cuff: external rotations 3×15/side, prone Y-T-W 2×10 each\nFRI — Heavy\n* Snatch, singles to 106 kg (90%). Stop at the first miss\n* Clean & jerk, singles to 110 kg (85%). Stop at the first miss\n* Back extensions 3×12\n\nWEEK 2 — Sep 14 to 20\nMON — Upper\n* Incline DB bench 4×8 @ 60 lb\n* Horizontal cable row 3×10 @ 140 lb\n* Arnold press 3×8 @ 45 lb\n* DB curls 2×10 @ 35 lb + toes-to-bar 3×8\nTUE — Front squat + clean pull\n* Front squat 4×3 @ 97.5 kg (75%)\n* Clean pull 4×3 @ 123 kg (95%)\n* Back extensions 3×12 @ 45 lb\n",
